# directory is ignored, not just chunks.json: on an actual standalone clone/
# deploy of this repo, data/ won't exist as a junction at all, and a fresh
# data/chunks.json + data/vocab.yaml need to land here by whatever means
# that deployment target uses (see Dockerfile's own comment on this).
data/

